      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "One pipeline per request",
      "items": [
        "Each lane isolates one request family: UI call, Request DTO, Controller, DB methods, Response DTO, UI consumer.",
        "Every pipeline starts in a UI view and ends in a UI view — reads end where the user consumes them.",
        "Phases mark Initiate, Serve, and Consume across all lanes."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Full route inventory",
      "items": [
        "Auth+users: POST /api/auth/register, POST /api/auth/login, GET /api/users/me, PUT /api/users/me. Calls: AuthService.register/login, UserService.getProfile/updateProfile.",
        "KYC: POST /api/kyc/applications multipart+json, GET /my-status, GET /documents/{id}/content, admin list+approve+reject. Uploads via KycUploadService.submit; files land in temp_images; decisions via KycService.approve/reject.",
        "Recipients, wallets, bank: full CRUD plus transfer, withdraw, convert, receive-demo, link, topup, ledger reads. Calls: RecipientService.create/list/update, BankAccountService.link/list/topup/withdraw, DemoFundingService.receiveDemo, transfers.transfer, WalletConversionService.convert, reads via WalletQueryService.",
        "Payments: draft, quotes GET+POST, recommend-route, confirm, cancel, list, get, GET /fx/rate. Calls: PaymentService.draft, QuoteService.createOrCurrent/get, PaymentConfirmationService.confirm.",
        "Payout: submit, retry, switch-route, refund, admin refund+reconcile, timeline read. Submit via execution.perform (PayoutExecutionService); refund via recovery.refundFunded; reconcile via reconciler.reconcile.",
        "Catalog: routes, rail-types, providers CRUD, routes CRUD, provider-summary report. Reads via RouteCatalogService.listRoutes/metricFor/recommend; writes via TransferProviderService/TransferRouteService; rails via RailRegistry; reports via ReportQueryService.providerSummary.",
        "Policy: doc+chunk+guidance CRUD plus index. Docs via PolicyDocumentService.create/list/getById/update; chunks via PolicyChunkService.addChunk/list/updateChunk/deleteChunk; guidance via PolicyGuidanceService.add/list/update/delete; removal via PolicyDeletionService.delete; indexing via PolicyIndexingService.index. Compliance: case CRUD plus approve+reject+delete via ComplianceCaseService.create/list/getById/approve/reject/deleteManualCase.",
        "Copilot: ask plus ask/stream SSE via CopilotService.ask/stream. Tickets: user CRUD plus admin list+update via TicketService.create/getOwned/list/listForAdmin/changeStatus."
      ]
    },
